<span id="page-11-3"></span>

| Number of Futures | One-Level Design | Two-level Design |  |
|-------------------|------------------|------------------|--|
| rumber of rutures | Time(ms)         | Time(ms)         |  |
| 1024              | 1.2              | 0.1              |  |
| 2048              | 2.3              | 0.1              |  |
| 4096              | 2.8              | 0.2              |  |
| 8192              | 3.4              | 0.4              |  |
